This package contains the Daytona agent skill from daytona/skills
(https://github.com/daytona/skills), Apache License 2.0, at commit
1d33f46d16a10f5c510d20c480c53315866ce675.

Changes made for AgentHub: the main entrypoint is a bounded fleet workflow;
upstream SDK workflows are moved to references/sdk-workflows.md and their
relative links adjusted. All upstream SDK reference directories are bundled,
including Go, Java and Ruby. Fleet guidance, credential-selection documentation,
a child-process key selector and synthetic offline tests are added. Vendor
contact addresses are replaced by "Daytona support" and "Daytona sales", and
PEM markers around placeholder keys and example proxy hosts are changed so the
public repository scan stays strict. See LICENSE.

